# script-ch5.rpyc:88
translate chinese ch5_main_291cd73e:

    # "It's the day of the festival."
    "学园祭当天到了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:89
translate chinese ch5_main_f55f58cd:

    # "Of all days, I expected this to be the one where I'd be walking to school with Sayori."
    "我原以为，今天会是那个终于能和纱世里一起走去学校的日子。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:90
translate chinese ch5_main_5f35e367:

    # "But Sayori isn't answering her phone."
    "可纱世里的电话一直无人接听。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:91
translate chinese ch5_main_aa057f44:

    # "I considered going to her house to wake her up, but decided that's a little too much."
    "我想过要去她家叫醒她，又觉得这样未免有点过了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:92
translate chinese ch5_main_66ad1f62:

    # "Meanwhile, the preparations for the event should be nearly complete."
    "而活动前的准备，此刻应该已近尾声。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:94
translate chinese ch5_main_e71f443a:

    # "I managed to carry all the cupcakes myself by carefully stacking two trays."
    "我小心地把两盘纸杯蛋糕叠在一起，总算一个人全部拿下了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:95
translate chinese ch5_main_5f772eb6:

    # "Natsuki is already texting up a storm, but I can't respond, thanks to my hands being full."
    "夏树的消息已经轰炸了一路，可我两手满满腾不出空，只能装作没看见。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:97
translate chinese ch5_main_01a9488e:

    # "The banner Yuri and I painted is dry, and I gently rolled it up to take with me."
    "我和优里画的横幅已经干透，我把它轻轻卷好带走。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:98
translate chinese ch5_main_6156c542:

    # "She sent me a pleasant text reminding me not to forget anything, and I reassured her."
    "她发来一条体贴的消息，提醒我别忘了东西，我回她放心。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:99
translate chinese ch5_main_12c35a24:

    # "Funnily enough, I probably feel the same way as Natsuki about the event."
    "有趣的是，对这场活动的心情，我大概和夏树一模一样。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch5_main_201144fc:

    # "I'm more excited for it to be over so I can spend time with Sayori and [ch4_name] at the festival."
    "我更盼着它赶紧结束，好在学园祭上陪纱世里和[ch4_name]好好玩玩。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch5_main_8ede78be:

    # "But knowing Monika, I'm sure the event will be great, too."
    "不过既然是莫妮卡操办，活动本身也一定不会差。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:105
translate chinese ch5_main_f6a40c3b:

    # m "[player]!"
    m "[player]！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:106
translate chinese ch5_main_83e6198b:

    # m "You're the first one here."
    m "你是第一个到的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:107
translate chinese ch5_main_cbd0885b:

    # m "Thanks for being early!"
    m "谢谢你来得这么早！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:108
translate chinese ch5_main_b16212d3:

    # mc "That's funny, I thought at least Yuri would be here by now."
    mc "奇怪，我还以为至少优里会先到呢。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:109
translate chinese ch5_main_869ed546:

    # "Monika is placing little booklets on each of the desks in the classroom."
    "莫妮卡正往教室的每张课桌上摆放小册子。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:110
translate chinese ch5_main_158d922b:

    # "They must be the ones she prepared that have all the poems we're performing."
    "应该就是她准备的、收录了我们要朗诵的全部诗作的那种册子。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:111
translate chinese ch5_main_1fd6873b:

    # "In the end, I found a random poem online that I thought Monika would like, and submitted it."
    "至于我，最后是网上随便找了首觉得莫妮卡会喜欢的诗，交了上去。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:112
translate chinese ch5_main_8185735f:

    # "So, that's the one I'll be performing."
    "所以，我要朗诵的就是那一首。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:113
translate chinese ch5_main_185b9181:

    # m 1d "I'm surprised you didn't bring Sayori with you."
    m 1d "没想到你居然没和纱世里一起来。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:114
translate chinese ch5_main_c458dfb9:

    # mc "Yeah, she overslept again..."
    mc "唉，她又睡过头了……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:115
translate chinese ch5_main_b260a3a6:

    # mc "That dummy."
    mc "那个小笨蛋。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:116
translate chinese ch5_main_81fc5eee:

    # mc "You'd think that on days this important, she'd try a little harder..."
    mc "这么重要的日子，怎么也该努力一点的吧……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:117
translate chinese ch5_main_e8c60bf9:

    # "I say that, but I suddenly remember what Sayori told me yesterday..."
    "话虽这么说，我却猛然想起纱世里昨天对我说的话……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:118
translate chinese ch5_main_bfc9484c:

    # "And I suddenly feel awful, knowing it's not nearly that simple for her."
    "一阵难受涌上来——我知道，对她来说，这远没有那么简单。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:119
translate chinese ch5_main_804f14c9:

    # "I only said it because it's the way I'm used to thinking."
    "我那样说，只是因为习惯了那样思考。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:120
translate chinese ch5_main_bf0874e3:

    # "But..."
    "可是……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:121
translate chinese ch5_main_b06045eb:

    # "Maybe I should have gone to wake her up after all?"
    "早知道，是不是还是应该去叫醒她？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:122
translate chinese ch5_main_716c1a0f:

    # m 1k "Ahaha."
    m 1k "啊哈。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:123
translate chinese ch5_main_39018d06:

    # m 4b "You should take a little responsibility for her, [player]!"
    m 4b "你也该对她负点责任了哦，[player]！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:124
translate chinese ch5_main_a7c132be:

    # m "I mean, especially after your exchange with her yesterday..."
    m "毕竟，昨天你们之间那番交流之后……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:125
translate chinese ch5_main_8ad57878:

    # m "You kind of left her hanging this morning, you know?"
    m "今天早上，你可是有点把她晾在那儿了呢？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:127
translate chinese ch5_main_2a8e5cd8:

    # mc "Exchange...?"
    mc "交流……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:128
translate chinese ch5_main_fae1792d:

    # mc "Monika-- You know about that??"
    mc "莫妮卡——你都知道了？？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:129
translate chinese ch5_main_22f1452d:

    # m 2a "Of course I do."
    m 2a "当然。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:130
translate chinese ch5_main_bad6f1a7:

    # m "I'm the club president, after all."
    m "我可是部长，不是吗。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:131
translate chinese ch5_main_bcfeb37f:

    # mc "But--!"
    mc "可是——！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:132
translate chinese ch5_main_13e443ec:

    # "I stammer, embarrassed."
    "我羞得语无伦次。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:133
translate chinese ch5_main_14d59814:

    # "Did Sayori really tell her about it that quickly?"
    "纱世里竟然这么快就告诉她了？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:135
translate chinese ch5_main_7b4085e0:

    # "That we're...a couple now?"
    "说我们……现在成了恋人？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:136
translate chinese ch5_main_e98494a0:

    # "I didn't really plan on bringing it up with anyone yet..."
    "我还压根没打算跟任何人提这件事……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:138
translate chinese ch5_main_7078ecec:

    # "About how I basically turned down her confession?"
    "说我几乎等于拒绝了她的告白？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:139
translate chinese ch5_main_841118bf:

    # "That makes me really seem like the bad guy here..."
    "这样一来，我岂不是彻底成了坏人……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:140
translate chinese ch5_main_bea221f2:

    # "But I'm the one who knows what's best for her, right?"
    "可我才是最清楚什么对她好的人，不是吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:141
translate chinese ch5_main_9098da49:

    # mc "Jeez..."
    mc "真是的……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:142
translate chinese ch5_main_c012ccb9:

    # mc "You don't know the full story at all, so..."
    mc "你根本不知道全部经过，所以……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:143
translate chinese ch5_main_61ca7335:

    # m 2j "Don't worry."
    m 2j "别担心。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:144
translate chinese ch5_main_8a0a254a:

    # m "I probably know a lot more than you think."
    m "我知道的，恐怕比你以为的多得多。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:145
translate chinese ch5_main_bbe4458e:

    # mc "Eh...?"
    mc "诶……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:146
translate chinese ch5_main_0ad66631:

    # "Monika is being as friendly as usual, but for some reason I felt a chill down my spine after hearing that."
    "莫妮卡的语气一如既往地亲切，可不知为何，这句话却让我脊背一阵发凉。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:147
translate chinese ch5_main_115550e4:

    # m 5 "Hey, do you want to check out the pamphlets?"
    m 5 "对了，要看看宣传册吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:148
translate chinese ch5_main_3dd8757c:

    # m "They came out really nice!"
    m "做出来的效果特别好！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:149
translate chinese ch5_main_b1ac94f7:

    # mc "Yeah, sure."
    mc "好啊。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:150
translate chinese ch5_main_cf774ef8:

    # "I grab one of the pamphlets laid out on the desks."
    "我从课桌上拿起一本册子。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:151
translate chinese ch5_main_c358e345:

    # mc "Oh yeah, they really did."
    mc "哦，确实很棒。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:152
translate chinese ch5_main_2dd533a0:

    # mc "Something like this will definitely help people take the club more seriously."
    mc "有这样的东西，大家肯定会更认真地看待我们社团。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:153
translate chinese ch5_main_9d72086a:

    # m "Yeah, I thought so too!"
    m "嗯，我也这么想！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:156
translate chinese ch5_main_e9739dad:

    # "I flip through the pages."
    "我翻动册页。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:157
translate chinese ch5_main_dcc9e068:

    # "Each member's poem is neatly printed on its own page, giving it an almost professional feel."
    "每位成员的诗都工整地印在专属的一页上，几乎有了几分正式出版物的质感。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:158
translate chinese ch5_main_d58b0f7f:

    # "I recognize Natsuki's and Yuri's poems from the ones they performed during our practice."
    "夏树和优里的诗，正是练习那天她们朗诵过的那两首。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:159
translate chinese ch5_main_4ad8684c:

    # mc "What's this...?"
    mc "这是……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:160
translate chinese ch5_main_781439d4:

    # "I flip to Sayori's poem."
    "我翻到了纱世里的诗。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:161
translate chinese ch5_main_48cf059d:

    # "It's different from the one she practiced."
    "不是她练习时念的那首。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:162
translate chinese ch5_main_d1acea01:

    # "It's one that I haven't read before..."
    "这是一首我从没读过的诗……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:164
translate chinese ch5_main_f9d65918:

    # mc "Ah--"
    mc "啊——"

# script-ch5.rpyc:165
translate chinese ch5_main_ce9ffd82:

    # "What is this...?"
    "这写的是什么……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:166
translate chinese ch5_main_f8df116d:

    # "Reading the poem, I get a pit in my stomach."
    "读着这首诗，我的胃里一阵发紧。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:168
translate chinese ch5_main_de87a206:

    # m "[player]?"
    m "[player]？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:169
translate chinese ch5_main_6a3f2020:

    # m "What's wrong?"
    m "怎么了？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:170
translate chinese ch5_main_ef5f85f4:

    # mc "Ah, nothing..."
    mc "啊，没什么……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:171
translate chinese ch5_main_db0952f0:

    # "This poem feels completely different from everything else Sayori's written."
    "这首诗的感觉，和纱世里以往写的任何一首都完全不同。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:172
translate chinese ch5_main_38f127a1:

    # "But more than that..."
    "而且不止如此……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:173
translate chinese ch5_main_d0abb0e9:

    # mc "I-I changed my mind!"
    mc "我、我改主意了！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:174
translate chinese ch5_main_45476ba9:

    # mc "I'm going to go get Sayori, so..."
    mc "我要去接纱世里，所以……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:175
translate chinese ch5_main_4db600d5:

    # m "Ah--"
    m "啊——"

# script-ch5.rpyc:176
translate chinese ch5_main_0ceabd85:

    # m 1b "Well, alright!"
    m 1b "好啊，没问题！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:177
translate chinese ch5_main_69a061e2:

    # m "Try not to take too long, okay?"
    m "尽量别去太久，好吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:179
translate chinese ch5_main_80ea11e1:

    # "I quickly leave the classroom."
    "我快步离开教室。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:180
translate chinese ch5_main_08b7a135:

    # m "Don't strain yourself~"
    m "路上别太勉强自己哦~"

# script-ch5.rpyc:181
translate chinese ch5_main_e2a4926d:

    # "Monika calls that out after me."
    "莫妮卡的声音从身后传来。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:182
translate chinese ch5_main_a2c82474:

    # "I quicken my pace."
    "我加快了脚步。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:185
translate chinese ch5_main_1642a559:

    # "What was I thinking?"
    "我到底在想什么？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:186
translate chinese ch5_main_b22de3d6:

    # "I should have tried a little bit harder for Sayori."
    "我本该为纱世里再多努力一点的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:187
translate chinese ch5_main_bf20ec7b:

    # "It's not a big deal to at least wait for her, or help her wake up."
    "等她一会儿，或者去叫她起床，又算得了什么大事。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:188
translate chinese ch5_main_e601aa4e:

    # "Even the simple gesture of walking her to school makes her really happy."
    "哪怕只是陪她走一趟上学路，都能让她开心好久。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:189
translate chinese ch5_main_70e7cabf:

    # "Besides..."
    "更何况……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:190
translate chinese ch5_main_68430306:

    # "I told her yesterday that things will be the same as they always have been."
    "我昨天才对她说过，一切都会像从前一样。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:191
translate chinese ch5_main_e35fe926:

    # "That's all she needs, and what I want to give her."
    "那是她需要的全部，也是我想给她的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:194
translate chinese ch5_main_558b962d:

    # "I reach Sayori's house and knock on the door."
    "我到了纱世里家，敲了敲门。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:195
translate chinese ch5_main_b8d78e77:

    # "I don't expect an answer, since she's not picking up her phone, either."
    "我不指望有人应门——毕竟连电话她都没接。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:196
translate chinese ch5_main_a19898c6:

    # "Like yesterday, I open the door and let myself in."
    "和昨天一样，我推开门，自己走了进去。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:198
translate chinese ch5_main_e766b9e2:

    # mc "Sayori?"
    mc "纱世里？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:199
translate chinese ch5_main_4f4ec354:

    # "She really is a heavy sleeper..."
    "她睡得可真沉……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:200
translate chinese ch5_main_17df0a8d:

    # "I swallow."
    "我咽了口口水。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:201
translate chinese ch5_main_5166b167:

    # "I can't believe I ended up doing this after all."
    "没想到，我最终还是走到这一步了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:202
translate chinese ch5_main_66baf796:

    # "Waking her up in her own house..."
    "在她家里叫她起床……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:204
translate chinese ch5_main_7e7f0370:

    # "That really is something that a boyfriend would do, isn't it?"
    "这确实像是男朋友才会做的事呢，不是吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:206
translate chinese ch5_main_d39780a5:

    # "Isn't that more like something a boyfriend would do?"
    "那不就更像是男朋友才会做的事吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:207
translate chinese ch5_main_cc4d5947:

    # "In any case..."
    "总之……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:208
translate chinese ch5_main_eff61fd1:

    # "It just feels right."
    "这种感觉，刚刚好。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:210
translate chinese ch5_main_b771a755:

    # "Outside Sayori's room, I knock on her door."
    "我在纱世里的房门外，敲了敲门。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:211
translate chinese ch5_main_e766b9e2_1:

    # mc "Sayori?"
    mc "纱世里？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:212
translate chinese ch5_main_2d697678:

    # mc "Wake up, dummy..."
    mc "起床了，小笨蛋……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:213
translate chinese ch5_main_4f673053:

    # "There's no response."
    "没有任何回应。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:214
translate chinese ch5_main_e55755b1:

    # "I really didn't want to have to enter her room like this..."
    "我真的不想就这样闯进她的房间……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:215
translate chinese ch5_main_5f524499:

    # "Isn't it kind of a breach of privacy?"
    "这多少有点侵犯隐私了吧？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:216
translate chinese ch5_main_92ad08b5:

    # "But she really leaves me no choice."
    "可她实在没给我留别的选择。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:217
translate chinese ch5_main_b0993b5c:

    # "I gently open the door."
    "我轻轻推开了门。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:218
translate chinese ch5_main_414399e6:

    # mc "{cps=30}.......Sayo--{/cps}{nw}"
    mc "{cps=30}……纱世——{/cps}{nw}"

# script-ch5.rpyc:296
translate chinese ch5_main_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:300
translate chinese ch5_main_d9da181d:

    # "What the hell...?"
    "搞什么……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:301
translate chinese ch5_main_3f892db7:

    # "{i}What the hell??{/i}"
    "{i}这搞什么啊？？{/i}"

# script-ch5.rpyc:302
translate chinese ch5_main_3e132bf6:

    # "Is this a nightmare?"
    "这是噩梦吗？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:303
translate chinese ch5_main_bee33b8a:

    # "It...has to be."
    "一定……是噩梦。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:304
translate chinese ch5_main_b79b8271:

    # "This isn't real."
    "这不是真的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:305
translate chinese ch5_main_f7d3bace:

    # "There's no way this can be real."
    "这不可能是真的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:306
translate chinese ch5_main_d463aeb5:

    # "Sayori wouldn't do this."
    "纱世里不会做这种事。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:307
translate chinese ch5_main_80b8347e:

    # "Everything was normal up until a few days ago."
    "直到几天前，一切都还那么正常。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:308
translate chinese ch5_main_bcc0cf21:

    # "That's why I can't believe what my eyes are showing me...!"
    "所以我无法相信眼前所见……！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:310
translate chinese ch5_main_14052544:

    # "I suppress the urge to vomit."
    "我强忍着呕吐的冲动。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:311
translate chinese ch5_main_83c08dc6:

    # "Just yesterday..."
    "就在昨天……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:312
translate chinese ch5_main_63d916b6:

    # "I told Sayori I would be there for her."
    "我还对纱世里说，我会一直陪着她。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:313
translate chinese ch5_main_60eed88f:

    # "I told her I know what's best, and that everything will be okay."
    "我说我知道什么对她最好，说一切都会好起来。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:314
translate chinese ch5_main_d7afa724:

    # "Then why...?"
    "那为什么……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:315
translate chinese ch5_main_b65618dd:

    # "Why would she do this...?"
    "她为什么要这样做……？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:316
translate chinese ch5_main_914b926a:

    # "How could I be so helpless?"
    "我怎么就这么无能为力？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:317
translate chinese ch5_main_ef4dcc76:

    # "What did I do wrong?"
    "我到底做错了什么？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:319
translate chinese ch5_main_be3441df:

    # "Confessing to her..."
    "向她告白……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:320
translate chinese ch5_main_5d397de2:

    # "I shouldn't have confessed to her."
    "我不该向她告白的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:321
translate chinese ch5_main_28eecbc0:

    # "That's not what Sayori needed at all."
    "那根本不是纱世里需要的。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:322
translate chinese ch5_main_83b32ad7:

    # "She even told me how painful it is for others to care about her."
    "她甚至说过，被人关心对她来说有多痛苦。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:323
translate chinese ch5_main_866f2bae:

    # "Then why did I confess to her, and make her feel even worse?"
    "那我为什么还要告白，让她更加难受？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:325
translate chinese ch5_main_c298f032:

    # "Turning down her confession..."
    "拒绝她的告白……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:326
translate chinese ch5_main_43f22dd0:

    # "That has to have been what pushed her over the edge."
    "一定是那个把她推下了悬崖。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:327
translate chinese ch5_main_ed1a20bb:

    # "Her agonized scream still echoes in my ears."
    "她那声痛苦的嘶喊，至今还在我耳边回荡。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:328
translate chinese ch5_main_390af3d1:

    # "Why did I do that to her when she needed me the most?"
    "在她最需要我的时候，我为什么要那样对她？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:329
translate chinese ch5_main_52adb6dd:

    # "Why was I so selfish?"
    "我为什么那么自私？"

# script-ch5.rpyc:330
translate chinese ch5_main_b8970560:

    # "This is my fault--!"
    "这都是我的错——！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:331
translate chinese ch5_main_784c9188:

    # "My swarming thoughts keep telling me everything I could have done to prevent this."
    "纷乱的念头不断列举着，本可以阻止这一切的每一种可能。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:332
translate chinese ch5_main_38a05e13:

    # "If I just spent more time with her."
    "如果我多陪陪她。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:333
translate chinese ch5_main_61323b0a:

    # "Walked her to school."
    "陪她走上学路。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:335
translate chinese ch5_main_fafa7f27:

    # "And remained friends with her, like it always has been..."
    "像从前那样，继续做她的朋友……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:337
translate chinese ch5_main_40330930:

    # "And gave her what I know she wanted out of our relationship..."
    "把她真正想要的那种关系，完完整整地给她……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:338
translate chinese ch5_main_b500c19c:

    # "...Then I could have prevented this."
    "……我本可以阻止这一切。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:339
translate chinese ch5_main_3fb68386:

    # "I know I could have prevented this!"
    "我明明可以阻止这一切的！"

# script-ch5.rpyc:340
translate chinese ch5_main_dbc1a352:

    # "Screw the Literature Club."
    "文学部什么的，都见鬼去吧。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:341
translate chinese ch5_main_6ca38f65:

    # "Screw the festival."
    "学园祭什么的，也见鬼去吧。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:342
translate chinese ch5_main_9e6ea412:

    # "I just...lost my best friend."
    "我刚……失去了我最好的朋友。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:343
translate chinese ch5_main_bf83b2a4:

    # "Someone I grew up with."
    "一个从小陪我长大的人。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:344
translate chinese ch5_main_8166b65b:

    # "She's gone forever now."
    "她永远地离开了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:345
translate chinese ch5_main_1346d49e:

    # "Nothing I do can bring her back."
    "无论我做什么，都换不回她了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:346
translate chinese ch5_main_47810304:

    # "This isn't some game where I can reset and try something different."
    "这不是那种能读档重来、换个选择的游戏。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:347
translate chinese ch5_main_061507cc:

    # "I had only one chance, and I wasn't careful enough."
    "机会只有一次，而我没能好好珍惜。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:348
translate chinese ch5_main_34819040:

    # "And now I'll carry this guilt with me until I die."
    "这份罪孽，我会背负到死。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:349
translate chinese ch5_main_aa24ed84:

    # "Nothing in my life is worth more than hers..."
    "我生命里的任何东西，都不如她的重要……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:350
translate chinese ch5_main_96fa7cd8:

    # "But I still couldn't do what she needed from me."
    "可我还是没能做到她需要我做的事。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:351
translate chinese ch5_main_226d890f:

    # "And now..."
    "而现在……"

# script-ch5.rpyc:352
translate chinese ch5_main_ad63a323:

    # "I can never take it back."
    "我永远都无法挽回了。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:353
translate chinese ch5_main_b8dc6375:

    # "Never."
    "永远。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:354
translate chinese ch5_main_b8dc6375_1:

    # "Never."
    "永远。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:355
translate chinese ch5_main_b8dc6375_2:

    # "Never."
    "永远。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:356
translate chinese ch5_main_b8dc6375_3:

    # "Never."
    "永远。"

# script-ch5.rpyc:357
translate chinese ch5_main_e650a699:

    # "Never..."
    "永远……"
